Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.27,0:00:00.27,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato. 20 TL
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.36,0:00:17.78,KP,,0000,0000,0000,,Anyway, don’t worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.37,0:00:21.37,KP,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(0,770)}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.72,0:00:38.55,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.85,0:00:40.72,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Y-Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.72,0:00:43.98,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,No matter how thick-headed you are,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.98,0:00:46.56,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,you’ll eventually catch a cold with the window open.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.85,0:00:48.81,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,But I’m…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.74,0:00:54.57,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I’m freezing, got it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.66,0:00:58.82,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I’m sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.33,0:01:02.83,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It really is quite cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.20,0:01:06.92,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, we just entered February.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.92,0:01:09.75,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Now that I think about it it, at the convenience store,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.75,0:01:12.59,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,there were a lot of magazines with chocolate on the covers.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.42,0:01:18.26,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Maybe eating chocolate makes people feel warmer!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.26,0:01:21.10,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,That’s because Valentine’s Day is coming up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.56,0:01:24.48,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Valentine’s Day?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.27,0:00:00.27,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,{opening}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.27,0:00:00.27,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,“…Travelers.”
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.11,0:03:03.82,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.08,0:03:13.25,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,February 14th is Valentine’s Day, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.38,0:03:16.04,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,What about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.04,0:03:19.26,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Should we hold a Valentine’s party at Yomogi Preschool?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.84,0:03:22.51,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Why at a preschool?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.22,0:03:25.51,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,You don’t hold them in preschools?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.89,0:03:30.18,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,They happen, but in Japan, it’s the day when you give out chocolates, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.18,0:03:31.14,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.14,0:03:33.35,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,That’s what it said in a book!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.35,0:03:34.81,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,So even in a preschool…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.23,0:03:37.02,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,The girls give them to guys, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.95,0:03:44.97,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It’s the day when girls give chocolate to guys they like.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.07,0:03:48.49,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,That’s what Valentine’s Day is about?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.49,0:03:51.08,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, the opposite has been happening lately, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.58,0:03:54.42,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,But anyway, you really don’t know anything, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.42,0:03:57.42,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,The one I like…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.47,0:04:02.42,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.72,0:04:07.10,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Why not try a Valentine’s party?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.10,0:04:16.10,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Sayaka-sensei… seems to have something on her mind again.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.40,0:04:22.32,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,She’s hurting a lot, but she’s trying not to show it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.32,0:04:31.62,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I was thinking we could cheer her up, at least a little, on Valentine’s Day.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.79,0:04:37.83,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,We can’t, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.83,0:04:42.05,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,The preschool doesn’t have the money to do something like that right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.05,0:04:43.22,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It’s all right!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.63,0:04:47.43,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Ch-Chiroru can share some ingredients with us, I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.43,0:04:49.72,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,If we go in the morning and ask them,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.72,0:04:53.39,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,as long as we work for the chocolate we make, it should be fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.89,0:04:55.52,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Calm down a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.52,0:04:56.85,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Y-Yes…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.85,0:05:00.36,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,In other words, you make a deal to help out at the Chiroru cake bakery
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.36,0:05:05.70,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,in return for ingredients the preschool can use to make chocolates, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.15,0:05:07.43,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Right, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.41,0:05:14.75,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Um, did I do anything wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.75,0:05:16.58,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I’ve got a lot of work piled up,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.58,0:05:19.17,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,so helping out at Chiroru might be difficult…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.67,0:05:22.25,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I’ve got construction work at midnight too…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.25,0:05:24.17,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Only I need to help!{Big change, but think this is closer ot the meaning.}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.97,0:05:27.72,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,The manager said that I just need to help out
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.72,0:05:32.72,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,every day after Yomogi Preschool is over until Valentine’s Day!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.72,0:05:33.85,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,But…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.85,0:05:35.18,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It’s all right!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.18,0:05:37.35,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,For Valentine’s Day…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.35,0:05:39.96,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,…I’ll do my best!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.96,0:05:42.44,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Fight! Hiya! Hiya!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.28,0:05:49.20,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Then, good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.85,0:06:15.56,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato-chan wants to celebrate Valentine’s Day here?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.56,0:06:16.22,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.31,0:06:20.98,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,She sure is such a sweet girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.08,0:06:38.75,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks for waiting!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.46,0:06:40.79,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.08,0:06:44.25,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you for coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.55,0:06:48.13,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Good work.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.13,0:06:49.63,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Good work!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.18,0:06:52.14,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I can still work more!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.14,0:06:54.72,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I’d like that, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.72,0:06:56.97,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It’s closing time already.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.56,0:06:59.64,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It’s already that late?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.23,0:07:03.77,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Um, um… is there anything else I can help with?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.02,0:07:06.73,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Valentine’s Day is still two days away.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.73,0:07:08.65,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,You’ve worked plenty.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.65,0:07:12.53,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Then, would you put away the sign out front?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.53,0:07:14.78,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes! I’ll go do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.26,0:07:33.89,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,That hurt!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.89,0:07:37.64,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Looks like we fell in a weird way again.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.89,0:07:42.23,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,We didn’t land in the ocean or\Nsomething this time, so isn’t it better?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.23,0:07:45.11,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,We almost died that time!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.11,0:07:46.31,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Ioryogi-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.08,0:08:00.08,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,A girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.08,0:08:02.08,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It’s a world with humans!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.08,0:08:02.75,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.04,0:08:07.00,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,We don’t know if white meatbun{manju}-looking things speak here!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.46,0:08:08.96,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Ioryogi-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.80,0:08:14.01,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Um… this person’s called Kurogane-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.55,0:08:17.47,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,And I’m Fay.{or Fay or Fye or something? dunno which naming system you’re using since I don’t follow Tsubasa much} {It’s Faye I believe. -Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.47,0:08:19.26,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,And this is Syaoran-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.26,0:08:21.18,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,And this is…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.43,0:08:23.35,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.94,0:08:26.69,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Wh-What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.57,0:08:29.44,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Well…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.53,0:08:35.53,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I see!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.95,0:08:38.45,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Mokona, it’s okay to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.91,0:08:40.95,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,This girl isn’t surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.95,0:08:42.20,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.20,0:08:45.46,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,After all, Ioryogi-san’s also a talking stuffed animal!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.29,0:08:47.83,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Ioryogi-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.83,0:08:49.54,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.54,0:08:51.21,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,How long are you going to loiter?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.55,0:08:53.80,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,The manager’s worried about you{\fscx(200)}-
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.30,0:08:56.01,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Ioryogi-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.14,0:09:00.22,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,So that’s Ioryogi-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.27,0:09:04.31,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I’m Mokona. Nice to meet you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.48,0:09:06.60,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,You little…!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.60,0:09:08.31,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,You’re from that amusement park!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.27,0:00:00.27,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,9:14 eyecatch}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.51,0:09:36.72,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,You’re traveling?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.72,0:09:37.47,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.47,0:09:38.89,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,All four of you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.89,0:09:40.76,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Three plus one Mokona!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.76,0:09:41.81,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,One Mokona?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.81,0:09:43.35,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,That’s how you count off Mokonas!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.06,0:09:47.89,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,So that means, Ioryogi-san would be one Ioryogi-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.89,0:09:48.85,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.85,0:09:50.36,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,That’s not what it means!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.65,0:09:55.24,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It’s true… Kuro-sama and\NIoryogi-san do sound similar. {same seiyuu, yes…}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.24,0:09:56.49,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,No, we don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.24,0:09:56.49,KO,,0000,0000,0000,,No, we don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.49,0:09:58.57,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,They do.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.57,0:09:59.53,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,They really do.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.87,0:10:12.09,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,The Kurogane in this world is tiny and blue!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.09,0:10:14.09,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Shut up, you white meatbun!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.01,0:10:15.84,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,You stupid little…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.84,0:10:17.97,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Then, you came here for a journey?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.97,0:10:19.01,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,That’s right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.97,0:10:20.10,KO,,0000,0000,0000,,Quit running, you little punk! {Keeper: hmm… to leave turd or not lol}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.10,0:10:24.35,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I read about it in a book. You go to\Nall sorts of places when on a journey.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.35,0:10:26.77,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Have you already decided where you’re going?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.77,0:10:28.85,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,No… not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.06,0:10:32.19,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It’d be nice if we had a place to stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.19,0:10:32.94,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,But…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.94,0:10:35.28,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,We don’t have any money from this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.28,0:10:37.53,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,You don’t have money?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.53,0:10:40.47,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,The money we have now\Nprobably wouldn’t be of use here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.32,0:10:43.20,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,That sounds like a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.83,0:10:48.29,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, we don’t have any girls,\Nso camping out should be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.29,0:10:49.96,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Mokona’s a girl though.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.96,0:10:52.17,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,How can you tell the gender?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.17,0:10:53.54,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,The color?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.54,0:10:54.67,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,The cuteness!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.05,0:10:58.21,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Um, if you’re looking…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.88,0:11:02.32,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Would you like to stay at my place?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.32,0:11:03.60,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I knew it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.39,0:11:06.06,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,B-But…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.06,0:11:07.47,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It’s all right!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.47,0:11:08.64,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I have a room!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.64,0:11:11.14,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,But I only have one futon…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.14,0:11:13.98,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,But, but, if you all gather around to sleep…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.40,0:11:16.73,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,But you’re kind of big…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.73,0:11:21.07,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh! If we use both the top and bottom futons separately…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.07,0:11:23.62,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,If you only have one futon, do you live by yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.62,0:11:26.20,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,No, I’m with Ioryogi-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.62,0:11:28.04,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Then we really shouldn’t…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.04,0:11:29.62,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It’s really all right!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.95,0:11:31.58,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Let’s stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.58,0:11:32.87,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Um…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.87,0:11:34.42,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I’m Hanato Kobato!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.42,0:11:36.09,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks, Kobato-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.09,0:11:37.59,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, you guys…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.59,0:11:42.34,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Whatever happens, Ioryogi-san will protect you, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.68,0:11:44.76,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.85,0:11:50.14,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Now then, let’s go to Kobato-chan’s place!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.14,0:11:50.89,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.10,0:11:52.56,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.40,0:11:55.36,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Let’s head out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.02,0:11:59.28,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Is this really okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.28,0:12:02.11,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,He must have thought this\Nthrough if that’s his decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.74,0:12:03.86,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Kuro-tan.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.24,0:12:06.66,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Why are you frowning?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.66,0:12:09.37,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, I mixed up the two of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.74,0:12:11.33,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Or so I thought…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.33,0:12:14.87,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,That idiot probably didn’t think anything through!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.71,0:12:18.88,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I’m late!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.88,0:12:21.17,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I’ve got the day off from the preschool,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.17,0:12:24.26,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,but I still needed to be at Chiroru’s in the morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.51,0:12:27.05,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,We kept trying to wake you up though.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.05,0:12:28.85,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato’s a heavy sleeper.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.14,0:12:32.56,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,You’re no different no matter how many people are in the room.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.56,0:12:33.98,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.52,0:12:39.61,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Um… I’ll be heading out, but feel free to stay in my room!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.98,0:12:42.99,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato-chan, you’re going to a cake bakery, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.99,0:12:44.86,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, to help out!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.86,0:12:50.12,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Um… you’re going to get ingredients for Valentine’s Day chocolates, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.12,0:12:51.16,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.37,0:12:54.54,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Then we’ll help out too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.92,0:12:57.08,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,That sounds nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.08,0:12:58.71,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It’ll be our thanks for letting us stay here!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.00,0:13:01.25,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,For the store, let’s see…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.25,0:13:03.80,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Syaoran-kun, would you go with her?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.47,0:13:05.72,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,You’re good with food.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.05,0:13:10.01,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I don’t think Kuro-sama would be suited for a cake bakery…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.01,0:13:11.60,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I wouldn’t want to anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.85,0:13:15.10,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Kuro-tan and I will find some work somewhere else.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.10,0:13:16.35,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,To gather some funds.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.90,0:13:19.36,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Mokona…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.36,0:13:21.11,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I’ll be with Ioryogi-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.07,0:13:23.40,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.40,0:13:25.57,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I feel friendly today!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.57,0:13:27.47,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, I don’t!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.70,0:13:29.57,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,That’s settled then.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.57,0:13:31.12,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Everyone, do your best!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.12,0:13:32.29,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.29,0:13:34.50,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Ioryogi-san, do your best, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.23,0:13:36.92,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Teamwork between friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.92,0:13:38.00,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I’m not your friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.00,0:13:40.63,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,But you must be jealous of Mokona’s cuteness!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.63,0:13:41.71,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Why would I be?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.51,0:13:47.01,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Yumi-chan, who’s that guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.01,0:13:50.05,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, Kobato-chan’s acquaintance.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.23,0:13:58.35,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Mokona’s pretty good at\Npretending to be a stuffed animal.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.35,0:14:00.25,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Don’t talk!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.56,0:14:02.69,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.69,0:14:05.74,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Shaoran-san, you’re really handy!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.74,0:14:07.24,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It’s easy once you’re used to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.24,0:14:11.37,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I’ve practiced so much, but I can’t do it so smoothly…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.45,0:14:16.75,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Don’t try to put it all in at once, but slowly, like this…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.37,0:14:20.00,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Slowly…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.05,0:14:25.42,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.60,0:14:38.77,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Don’t sing either!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.48,0:14:45.25,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Shaoran-san, have you and the others always been traveling?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.61,0:14:46.65,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.65,0:14:49.65,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,But we don’t have a destination.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.65,0:14:51.45,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.45,0:14:55.16,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,The purpose of it is pretty much to keep traveling.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.50,0:15:06.84,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Um… so you don’t know where you’re going next?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.42,0:15:09.40,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It’s difficult to figure that out.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.30,0:15:13.64,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,We don’t even know how long\Nwe can spend in any single place.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.02,0:15:20.89,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,But…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.69,0:15:24.92,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,There’s someone waiting for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.57,0:15:28.80,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Someone waiting for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.86,0:15:34.24,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I don’t know when I’ll return, but she’s back there waiting for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.29,0:15:39.54,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.87,0:15:42.92,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,…also have a place I want to go to.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.58,0:15:45.84,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I want to go there no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.09,0:15:51.30,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Is that because you have a reason for going there?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.01,0:15:56.51,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Or is it because you want to meet someone there?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.85,0:16:01.10,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Someone… I want to meet?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.07,0:16:52.61,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,The one I want to meet…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.58,0:17:02.58,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,We’ve done a lot of work!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.58,0:17:04.33,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,All you did was sit!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.33,0:17:06.92,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, working as a decoration!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.92,0:17:08.04,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,What’s with that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.04,0:17:09.79,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Welcome back!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.46,0:17:12.63,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,How was the cake bakery?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.63,0:17:14.67,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,We’re back!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.67,0:17:19.30,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Syaoran-san was very handy, and the manager complimented him a lot!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.30,0:17:20.22,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, no…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.22,0:17:23.68,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Although they said our clothes were unusual.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.98,0:17:25.64,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, our clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.64,0:17:27.60,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,We had a lot of problems too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.60,0:17:30.23,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Everyone asked if we were cosplaying.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.23,0:17:33.90,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It got complicated because you kept saying,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.90,0:17:36.20,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,“Does this count as cosplay in this world?”
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.61,0:17:38.45,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Here, for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.91,0:17:43.49,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It’s one envelope for one day, so it’s not much, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.49,0:17:45.66,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,But is it really okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.66,0:17:48.96,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, we’ll be happy if you take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.96,0:17:51.00,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It’s our thanks for letting us stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.50,0:17:53.30,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.30,0:17:56.38,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I’ll use it to help Yomogi Preschool!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.34,0:18:01.68,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Already?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.26,0:18:04.18,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,What’s wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.06,0:18:08.44,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,When this earpiece glows,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.44,0:18:10.19,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,we have to go to the next world.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.94,0:18:16.94,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks for letting us stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.94,0:18:20.32,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It was only one night, but it was fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.32,0:18:21.87,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry for the trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.87,0:18:26.31,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, no, sorry I couldn’t be of more help.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.21,0:18:29.62,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, is Kobato-chan…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.17,0:18:34.09,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,…right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.71,0:18:39.59,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It seems she’s rather insecure.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.72,0:18:41.01,KO,,0000,0000,0000,,That’s a really majestic light!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.01,0:18:43.76,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Isn’t it? Mokona really likes it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.76,0:18:48.06,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,As someone from another world, you can only watch over her…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.06,0:18:49.81,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,…and that goes for us too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.94,0:18:52.40,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.40,0:18:54.84,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I know that even without you telling me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.84,0:18:57.32,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I want one! I really want one!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.56,0:19:31.69,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I hope you can go to that place.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.48,0:19:35.23,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.46,0:19:56.42,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Who were they?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.42,0:19:58.63,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,They were from another world.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.21,0:20:02.72,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,The human world isn’t the only one around, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.26,0:20:06.60,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,The Celestial World, the Nether World, the Spirit World…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.60,0:20:10.14,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,There might be a lot of others, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.69,0:20:17.98,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I hope…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.98,0:20:23.45,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fscx95}…that their next world will be where\NSyaoran-san can meet the one waiting for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.27,0:00:00.27,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,{sign}valentine’s Party
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.80,0:20:41.59,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Everyone looks like they’re having fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.59,0:20:42.26,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.22,0:20:48.64,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato-chan really worked hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.64,0:20:50.93,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Well… yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.06,0:20:57.69,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato-chan, that looks weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.69,0:20:58.77,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.77,0:21:00.11,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,What is it supposed to be?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.69,0:21:02.86,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It’s supposed to be a star…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.86,0:21:04.99,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,You mean it’s not a starfish?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.99,0:21:06.86,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It looks like a starfish?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.37,0:21:11.12,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Not just chocolate, but she gave us money too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.91,0:21:16.50,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,And she brought wrappings and\Ncards with the chocolate as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.33,0:21:20.80,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I hope Kobato-chan isn’t pushing herself too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.72,0:21:28.51,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, hey. Yoshio-kun, who are you giving your chocolate to?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.51,0:21:31.76,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,My mom and dad. And my little sister!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.76,0:21:36.52,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I’ll give mine to my mom…\Nand Kobato-chan, if you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.14,0:21:38.94,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.56,0:21:42.19,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,You’ve gotta give your best Valentine’s chocolate
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.19,0:21:44.19,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,to the one you like the most, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.19,0:21:48.07,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato-chan, who are you going to give your best to?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.07,0:21:49.91,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.26,0:22:17.31,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,That Kobato… you’re making some for me too, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.16,0:22:35.49,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.09,0:22:47.51,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.43,0:22:50.43,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,You really…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.09,0:22:53.89,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,…don’t have any time left.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.27,0:00:00.27,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Next Episode
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.27,0:00:00.27,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,“…The Footsteps of Spring.”
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.27,0:00:02.27,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,
